{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the matching puzzle jungle of Fit My Cat's wild and wacky canine edition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picture this: your doggy pals plan to spend the most lazy day and stay at a cozy home with comfy rooms, just for them. But there's a snag \u2013 they're all vying for space on a colossal dog bed and need your finesse to make it work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level unveils a variety of dog breeds, each itching for a spot to lounge and unwind on the bed. Get ready to mingle with 27 breeds, from playful Poodles to cuddly Bulldogs, regal Golden Retrievers to very long Dachshunds, and beyond!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Here's what makes this doggone fun escapade bark to life:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >96 levels of dog beds ready to be filled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >27 different dog breeds with different shapes and sizes</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979080?t=1761294253","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979080/bb78852d11a6abe7a5eaa890638d392e25dba7b8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761294253","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979080/e2799b1ac0783674ddf14a80dedcd822f2989f8c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761294253","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979080/e2799b1ac0783674ddf14a80dedcd822f2989f8c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761294253","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"cont